<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tānā^gra</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τάναγρα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town of
				Bœotia</i>, now <i>Grimadha</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Dom.
				43, 111</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 7, 12, § 26</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Liv.
				33, 28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">35,
			51</span></i>. —Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tānā^graeus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Tanagra</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">meretrix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Dom. 43, 111</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Choroebus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 9, 745</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tānā^grĭcus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Tanagra</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">galli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 9, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 8, 2, 4</span></i> and 13.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
